        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The latest spec for CSS gap decoration contains an additional value \"overlap-join\" which Chromium ships as well.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Collector run in Chrome 149 release.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Followup to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4398629037\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29624\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29624/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29624\">#29624</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29795",
            "title": "Add overlap-join value to gap decoration properties",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-03T14:27:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-03T14:26:13.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
